{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57155","headline":"率题六章 第二章叹高遂背元志 · 傅翕","name":"率题六章 第二章叹高遂背元志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近背天宫乐，念苦暂羁斯。\n舒散金来抱，流缁布交知。\n唯仰相随善，依令使忘疲。\n同登八位境，共乐宝莲池。\n肉身变金体，妙果遂衆奇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}